{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20178",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 3.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Morning, come on through."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.86,
      "end_seconds": 8.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Afternoon, um, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.11,
      "end_seconds": 12.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.4,
      "end_seconds": 20.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "Hmm, so the thing is, I've got small red bumps on my wrists."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.25,
      "end_seconds": 24.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.26,
      "end_seconds": 33.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.89,
      "end_seconds": 62.79,
      "duration_seconds": 13.9,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.9, BP is 128 over 74, pulse is 64 beats a minute, SpO2 99 percent on room air. Okay, how long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.43,
      "end_seconds": 70.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "I mean, it's been going on for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.66,
      "end_seconds": 74.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Has there been scratching sores too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.29,
      "end_seconds": 78.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Yeah, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.47,
      "end_seconds": 79.17,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.49,
      "end_seconds": 86.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.72,
      "text": "I've also had itching especially at night, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.61,
      "end_seconds": 95.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "So, and what about rash on the face, oozing, swollen glands or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.88,
      "end_seconds": 99.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.89,
      "end_seconds": 103.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.44,
      "end_seconds": 106.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.87,
      "end_seconds": 110.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.42,
      "end_seconds": 114.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "No, you know, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.47,
      "end_seconds": 120.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.47,
      "end_seconds": 127.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Calamine lotion, when needed. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.92,
      "end_seconds": 147.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Right, have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.16,
      "end_seconds": 152.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Just my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.55,
      "end_seconds": 159.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "So, what about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.66,
      "end_seconds": 163.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.86,
      "end_seconds": 174.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.13,
      "end_seconds": 180.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.35,
      "end_seconds": 184.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.52,
      "end_seconds": 189.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.82,
      "end_seconds": 210.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.71,
      "end_seconds": 216.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "No, you know, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.87,
      "end_seconds": 221.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.83,
      "end_seconds": 228.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "I've, I've had gout for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.49,
      "end_seconds": 230.19,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.71,
      "end_seconds": 234.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.07,
      "end_seconds": 236.77,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.42,
      "end_seconds": 240.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.34,
      "end_seconds": 260.06,
      "duration_seconds": 8.72,
      "text": "There are small burrow-like tracks and red bumps between the fingers and on the wrists, with scratch marks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.3,
      "end_seconds": 290.94,
      "duration_seconds": 26.64,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Taking everything into account, the most likely explanation is scabies. We shouldn't forget an allergic rash. You'll be taking permethrin cream, 5 percent, once, then again after a week, for two weeks. That should help with scabies. Come back in two weeks. Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.49,
      "end_seconds": 304.77,
      "duration_seconds": 13.28,
      "text": "So, I take the permethrin cream, 5 percent, once, then again after a week and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.31,
      "end_seconds": 311.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "So, yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.59,
      "end_seconds": 318.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.62,
      "end_seconds": 321.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Alright, take care now."
    }
  ]
}